  "worked_solution": "First, we multiply each component of $b$ by $\\frac{1}{2}.$ Then, we add the vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a+\\frac{1}{2}b & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+3 \\\\ -4+3 \\\\ 1+(-1) \\\\ 0+2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
